# Monoist Circuit-Feeder (flying 4/4): "When this creature enters, until end of turn, target creature you control gets +X/+0 and
# target creature an opponent controls gets -0/-X, where X is the number of artifacts you control." In turn 3 Bot1 pays {4}{B}{B}
# with Mox Jet, Mox Pearl, Mox Emerald and Black Lotus (sacrificed for its mana, so not counted): X = Jet, Pearl, Emerald, Memnite
# and the Circuit-Feeder itself = 5. Bot1's Memnite becomes 6/1 (power only) and Bot2's Wall of Earth (0/6) becomes 0/1
# (toughness only). Bot2's Mox Ruby and Mox Jet are artifacts too but not counted: "you control".

